Golf Day at #WeekendWithPapi was a reminder of what happens when people come together for a purpose bigger than themselves. The morning started with sun on the course, laughter in the air, and friendly competition that brought out the best in everyone. Every swing, every handshake, every moment on the green was about more than golf it was about community, connection, and making a real difference in the lives of children in need.

We want to give a special thank you to @konicaminoltaus our presenting sponsor, for helping make the day seamless and unforgettable. Your support turns experiences like this into impact that lasts far beyond the weekend.

